      "bbox": {
        "l": 143.9999,
        "t": 663.52184,
        "r": 557.2299000000003,
        "b": 640.28184
      },
      "content": "Use an arbor press to install the outboard INPRO VBXX-D into the bearing cover with the expulsion port (6) at the 6 o'clock position.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_1939",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_1939",
          "title": "Shaft sealing"
        }
      ],
      "page": 115,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1674",
      "reading_order": 1945,
      "section": "Shaft sealing",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 161.9999,
        "t": 637.00184,
        "r": 534.7399000000005,
        "b": 613.76184
      },
      "content": "Press the outboard INPRO VBXX-D down to where the stator location ramp (9) starts to avoid angular misalignment. There is a nominal 0.002 in. (0.051 mm) interference fit.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_1939",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_1939",
          "title": "Shaft sealing"
        }
      ],
